{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12105270","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12105270","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1210526001:":{"text":"아니? 어디서 들어온 거야?","source_cn":"嗯？你们从哪进来的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93CE7454AE08E763","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1210527001:1":{"text":"...이곳은 내 사람들이 포위하고 있는데, 너희는 대체 어떻게 들어온 거지?","source_cn":"……这里已经被我的人包围了，你们从哪里进来的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30910AED1E85DA29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1210527002:1":{"text":"음... 그게 말이죠...","source_cn":"呃……这个嘛……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94F66C84BA37C225","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1210527003:1":{"text":"비밀 통로로 온 거겠지?","source_cn":"我猜，是密道吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x675D9222AE262E66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1210527003":{"text":"비밀 통로로 온 거겠지?","source_cn":"我猜，是密道吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x675D9222AE262E66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1210527005:1":{"text":"물귀신파가 한밤중에 기습했는데, 마스터가 쫓아냈어요.","source_cn":"水鬼帮半夜偷袭，被主人打跑了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF8B6779CAB96CC77","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"물귀신파가 한밤중에 기습했는데, 마스터가 쫓아냈어요.","female":"물귀신파가 한밤중에 기습했는데, 마스터가 쫓아냈어요.","variant_male_record_index":"128422","variant_female_record_index":"128423","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1210527006:1":{"text":"우리가 발견한 비밀 통로를 지나니 이곳에 도착했고요!","source_cn":"我们发现了一条密道，穿过密道就到了这里！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4540DBE35D3A3E68","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1210527007:1":{"text":"물귀신... 비밀 통로에서 또 뭘 봤지?","source_cn":"水鬼……你们在密道里还看见了什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57923CD106E71543","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1210527008:1":{"text":"수비병을 봤어요! 블러디 로즈도 있고, 물귀신도 있었어요!","source_cn":"看到了守卫！有血薇帮的，还有水鬼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A458B52D536BAC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1210527009:1":{"text":"싸우던 중이었나?","source_cn":"他们在打斗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8145FFDFF5E0B6E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1210527010:1":{"text":"아니요... 그들은 비밀 통로의 기믹 승강기를 함께 지키고 